INTERVIEW ANSWERING APPROACH

1. Understand the requirement and clarify assumptions.
2. Explain the approach and WHY you selected it over alternatives.
3. Implement a working solution and explain edge cases.
4. Discuss time/space complexity, performance, security, logging and failure handling.

